  "name": "Careful Aim",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, you can use a bonus action to take careful aim until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>If you do so, the ranges of any ranged weapon you're wielding becomes (50 &times; your Proficiency Bonus)/(200 &times; your Proficiency Bonus) feet unless it's already more than that. Additionally, you ignore any disadvantage on ranged attacks imposed by weather-related effects, such as fog or strong winds.</p>\n<p>At 11th level, all ranged weapon attacks you make benefit from Careful Aim.</p>",
